<title>MALAYSIA: PSC stock suspended at company request.</title>
<headline>PSC stock suspended at company request.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of PSC Industries Bhd was suspended on Tuesday at the company's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Officials at the firm, which is involved in ship building and other activities, were not available for comment. Shares of PSC last traded unchanged at 31.50 ringgit before the suspension.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
